<title>UK: Euromarket turnover fell in week to 3 July - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover fell in week to 3 July - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in the Eurobond and related markets fell to $1.112 trillion in the week to July 3 from $1.202 trillion in the previous week, International Securities Market Association figures show (in billions of dollars).</p>
<p>					    LATEST WEEK	  PREVIOUS</p>
<p>WEEK</p>
<p> PRIMARY MARKET:			  57.67		 61.92</p>
<p> OF WHICH U.S. DOLLAR ISSUES:	 32.26		 32.38</p>
<p> SECONDARY MARKET:		    1044.30	     1140.50</p>
<p> OF WHICH U.S. DOLLAR ISSUES:	283.92		257.02</p>
<p> CLEARED THROUGH EUROCLEAR	   771.86		864.84</p>
<p> CLEARED THROUGH CEDEL		 341.11		337.58</p>
<p>--London newsroom,  +44 171 542 7658</p>
